# Lint after every change

After any code change, run `task lint-fix` in the module you touched and fix issues before finishing:

- Library / root module: from the repo root — `task lint-fix`
- CLI module: from `cmd/pal` — `task -d cmd/pal lint-fix` (or `cd cmd/pal && task lint-fix`)

If you changed both, run both. Do not leave lint or format failures for the user.
